Skin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-mr4n7649":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.8em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:alfabet,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Simple, family-tested recipes that turn busy weeknights into meals everyone will love.</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-mr4tle6o":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:13px;\">Life gets busy. Groceries pile up. The kids are hungry ten minutes ago. Cooking becomes just another thing on an already-long list.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:13px;\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:13px;\">That&#39;s exactly why we put this together.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:13px;\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.6em; font-size:13px;\">Inside <span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Easy Recipes for Every Family</span>, you&#39;ll find a handful of our favorite family-tested recipes - the ones we cook for our own kids, the ones our clients ask us to make when we&#39;re helping in their kitchens, and the ones that turn a regular Tuesday night into something a little more special.</p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-mr4tgvig":{"uri":"db5b77_2ffeb11c5be44208b2dd41b165c9fe04~mv2.jpg","alt":"GTFA lead magnet.jpg","width":2550,"h